1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,030
What if Stickman drew a door...

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,340
and the sky opened?

3
00:00:04,044 --> 00:00:05,244
He found a glowing chalk key

4
00:00:05,254 --> 00:00:06,904
hidden in the grass.

5
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,940
With one shaky line,

6
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,540
he drew a door in midair.

7
00:00:11,361 --> 00:00:13,041
Click. It opened.

8
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:16,560
Beyond it floated a kingdom of

9
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:17,557
clouds, golden bridges,

10
00:00:17,567 --> 00:00:19,830
and tiny spinning windmills.

11
00:00:21,008 --> 00:00:22,518
Stickman stepped through.

12
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:23,708
The door vanished.

13
00:00:24,344 --> 00:00:25,544
Then he heard a cry.

14
00:00:26,018 --> 00:00:27,794
A baby dragon was trapped in

15
00:00:27,804 --> 00:00:29,580
crystal vines above a raging

16
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:30,440
storm.

17
00:00:31,296 --> 00:00:33,596
Stickman ran across a narrow

18
00:00:33,606 --> 00:00:34,459
bridge. The planks began to

19
00:00:34,469 --> 00:00:35,319
shake.

20
00:00:35,532 --> 00:00:37,044
He drew a shield to block the

21
00:00:37,054 --> 00:00:37,904
sparks.

22
00:00:38,117 --> 00:00:39,067
Then a ladder.

23
00:00:39,077 --> 00:00:40,797
Then enormous scissors.

24
00:00:41,192 --> 00:00:43,542
Snip! Snip! The vines broke.

25
00:00:44,065 --> 00:00:45,935
The dragon leaped into his arms.

26
00:00:46,866 --> 00:00:47,892
But their rescue had woken

27
00:00:47,902 --> 00:00:48,996
something worse.

28
00:00:49,571 --> 00:00:51,811
A cracked storm crystal flashed.

29
00:00:51,821 --> 00:00:53,591
The floating islands lurched.

30
00:00:54,461 --> 00:00:55,599
The bridge shattered behind

31
00:00:55,609 --> 00:00:56,459
them.

32
00:00:57,169 --> 00:00:58,779
The chalk key flickered.

33
00:00:58,789 --> 00:01:00,149
One drawing left.

34
00:01:00,675 --> 00:01:02,355
Stickman could draw a rocket.

35
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:03,970
Or a sword.

36
00:01:04,525 --> 00:01:06,885
Instead, he drew a giant,

37
00:01:06,895 --> 00:01:08,155
glowing heart.

38
00:01:09,373 --> 00:01:11,043
It wrapped around the crystal...

39
00:01:11,053 --> 00:01:12,423
and sealed the crack.

40
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:14,983
The wind fell silent.

41
00:01:15,695 --> 00:01:17,665
Sunlight flooded the sky.

42
00:01:18,161 --> 00:01:19,306
The dragon sneezed,

43
00:01:19,316 --> 00:01:20,681
releasing a trail of glittering

44
00:01:20,691 --> 00:01:22,011
bubbles.

45
00:01:22,546 --> 00:01:24,124
One bubble carried them toward a

46
00:01:24,134 --> 00:01:25,246
distant castle.

47
00:01:25,869 --> 00:01:27,082
But as they approached,

48
00:01:27,092 --> 00:01:28,380
the castle's enormous doors

49
00:01:28,390 --> 00:01:30,099
opened by themselves.

50
00:01:30,633 --> 00:01:33,353
Inside, two golden eyes blinked.

51
00:01:33,946 --> 00:01:35,616
Stickman squeezed the key.

52
00:01:36,042 --> 00:01:37,382
What would you draw next?

